<Slide style={{ background: '#0B1020', padding: 60 }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>⑨ 数据在自己手里：导出、备份、同步、体检</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>11 / 功能 8</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: 'rgba(34,211,238,0.4)', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, marginTop: 20 }}>
        <Image src="assets/settings-data.png" style={{ width: 372, height: 230, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #334155' }} />
        <Image src="assets/settings-sync.png" style={{ width: 372, height: 230, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #334155' }} />
        <Image src="assets/settings-checkup.png" style={{ width: 372, height: 230, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #334155' }} />
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, marginTop: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 372, padding: 14, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8, borderTop: '3px solid #22D3EE' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>一键导出 JSON</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>所有日程、笔记、附件索引导出成一个文件 —— 它是你的数据，跟这个软件无关。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 372, padding: 14, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8, borderTop: '3px solid #22D3EE' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>备份与恢复</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>本地快照随时存、随时回滚，误删一条也能找回来。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 372, padding: 14, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8, borderTop: '3px solid #4F46E5' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>同步（可选开关）</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>走你自己的 GitHub 私有仓库或本地文件夹；三路合并，冲突绝不自动覆盖。</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 12, padding: 16, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8, borderLeft: '3px solid #22D3EE' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#22D3EE' }}>一键体检</span>
            ：设置里每一项能力都告诉你"能不能用、为什么、去哪修" —— 没填 Key 就说没填 Key，模型没装就说没装，不允许"灰着但不解释"。                 右图就是体检页的真实样子。
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 670 }}>个人工作台 · v0.2.0</Text>
</Slide>
